# [V6OPS](../wg/v6ops.html)

## Summary

The V6OPS Working Group met to discuss several active working group drafts and individual proposals. Key topics included customer edge router requirements, ICMP/XLAT source address translation improvements, 5G IPv6-only deployment guidance, AAAA filtering/suppression in stub resolvers, Enhanced Dual Stack (EDS), First Hop Redundancy Protocols (FHRP) in IPv6, and Happy Eyeballs reporting considerations. 

The session was chaired by Nick Buraglio with assistance from co-chair XiPeng Xiao. The final scheduled presentations on IPv6 deployment statistics and path performance degradation could not be delivered due to audio technical issues and were moved to the mailing list.

